NAME: KNOWN BUG i-7d2612-672fff: a let in a template named like a parameter
DESCRIPTION: characterization, not a specification: the let's x should shadow the parameter x, but the argument 5 replaces the binder's uses (ADD.AB #1, #5 instead of the let's cell); see behtests/template_let_param.beh
SRC:
(program
  (define (t (x Num)) (let (x 1) (seq (ADD 1 x) (JMP 0) (DAT 0 (store x)))))
  (t 5))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  ADD.AB #1     , #5     
  JMP    #0     , #0     
_LET1 
  DAT    #0     , #1     
  DAT    $0     , $0     